  "description": "The condition for the fresh water snail to become a human being is to win the love of its housemate? Seungha, someone from ordinary single-member household, once came across with a feisty snail called 'Nokjo'. A cool-sweet healing living together romance of the top-level housekeeping neat freak snail and Seungha, the weary loner in her hectic routine. \n\n(Source: Kakao, translated)",
